#. type: Title #
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:1 docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub RPC"
msgstr "Hub RPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Hub RPC** (`HubRPC/1.0`) is the WebSocket transport between any Hub client and the agent runtime. It is implemented in [`packages/hub-rpc/`](../../packages/hub-rpc/) and served at **`/hub/rpc/v1`**.\n"
msgstr "**Hub RPC**（`HubRPC/1.0`）是任意 Hub 客户端与 agent 运行时之间的 WebSocket 传输层。实现位于 [`packages/hub-rpc/`](../../packages/hub-rpc/)，端点为 **`/hub/rpc/v1`**。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:10
msgid ""
"SAP (`SAP/1.0`) is a **session layer** on top of Hub RPC: true satellites "
"call `sap.attach` after connect; bundled SPA modules **never** attach."
msgstr ""
"SAP（`SAP/1.0`）是 Hub RPC 之上的**会话层**：真正的卫星在 connect 后调用 "
"`sap.attach`；壳内 bundled SPA 模块**从不** attach。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:11 docs/sap/transport.md:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "端点"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:13 docs/sap/transport.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "ws://{hub_host}:{port}/hub/rpc/v1\n"
msgstr "ws://{hub_host}:{port}/hub/rpc/v1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:18
msgid ""
"Derive from Hub HTTP URL: replace `http` with `ws`, strip trailing slash, "
"append `/hub/rpc/v1`. Helpers: `resolveHubRpcWsUrl` in `@freeanima/hub-rpc`."
msgstr ""
"由 Hub HTTP URL 推导：将 `http` 替换为 `ws`，去掉末尾斜杠，追加 `/hub/rpc/"
"v1`。辅助函数：`@freeanima/hub-rpc` 中的 `resolveHubRpcWsUrl`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:20
msgid ""
"Hub route: [`platform/src/sap/bun-route.ts`](../../platform/src/sap/bun-"
"route.ts)."
msgstr ""
"Hub 路由：[`platform/src/sap/bun-route.ts`](../../platform/src/sap/bun-"
"route.ts)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:21 docs/sap/transport.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Envelope kinds"
msgstr "信封类型"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `kind`      | Direction | Purpose |\n"
"| ----------- | --------- | ------- |\n"
"| `connect`   | Client → Hub | First frame; `protocol: HubRPC/1.0`, `auth_token` |\n"
"| `connected` | Hub → Client | `session_id`, `heartbeat_interval_sec` |\n"
"| `req`       | Client → Hub | RPC (`id`, `method`, `payload`) |\n"
"| `res`       | Hub → Client | RPC reply |\n"
"| `evt`       | Both      | Async event (incl. `heartbeat`) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `kind`      | 方向         | 用途                                              |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `connect`   | Client → Hub | 首帧；`protocol: HubRPC/1.0`、`auth_token`        |\n"
"| `connected` | Hub → Client | `session_id`、`heartbeat_interval_sec`            |\n"
"| `req`       | Client → Hub | RPC（`id`、`method`、`payload`）                  |\n"
"| `res`       | Hub → Client | RPC 回复                                          |\n"
"| `evt`       | 双向         | 异步事件（含 `heartbeat`）                        |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:32
msgid ""
"Parse/serialize: `parseHubRpcEnvelope` / `serializeHubRpcEnvelope` in "
"`@freeanima/hub-rpc`."
msgstr ""
"解析/序列化：`@freeanima/hub-rpc` 中的 `parseHubRpcEnvelope` / "
"`serializeHubRpcEnvelope`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:36
msgid ""
"Every connection must send a valid **service API token** in the `connect` "
"payload (`auth_token`). The Hub verifies it with `verifyServiceApiToken` "
"([`core/src/db/pg/service-api-token/`](../../core/src/db/pg/service-api-"
"token/))."
msgstr ""
"每次连接必须在 `connect` 载荷（`auth_token`）中发送有效的**服务 API 令牌**。"
"Hub 通过 `verifyServiceApiToken` 验证（[`core/src/db/pg/service-api-token/`]"
"(../../core/src/db/pg/service-api-token/)）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:38
msgid ""
"Bundled clients read the token from `window.satelliteShell.remoteAuth.token` "
"(shell bridge). Local web dev may seed via `FREEANIMA_REMOTE_AUTH_TOKEN` or "
"Hub setup UI."
msgstr ""
"壳内 bundled 客户端从 `window.satelliteShell.remoteAuth.token`（shell "
"bridge）读取令牌。本地 Web 开发可通过 `FREEANIMA_REMOTE_AUTH_TOKEN` 或 Hub 设"
"置 UI 预置。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client profiles"
msgstr "客户端配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Profile | Package entry | `sap.attach` | Typical consumer |\n"
"| ------- | ------------- | ------------ | ---------------- |\n"
"| Bundled SPA | `getBundledHubRpcClient()` / `whenHubRpcReady()` | **No** | Chat, task, notification, diary, email modules |\n"
"| Satellite process | `createSatelliteHub()` in sap-contract | **Yes** | companion, pair-programming |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 配置            | Package 入口                                      | `sap.attach` | 典型消费者                                   |\n"
"| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ------------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Bundled SPA     | `getBundledHubRpcClient()` / `whenHubRpcReady()`  | **否**       | 聊天室、任务、通知、日记、邮件等模块         |\n"
"| Satellite 进程  | sap-contract 中的 `createSatelliteHub()`          | **是**       | companion、pair-programming                  |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:47
msgid ""
"Bundled SPA shares **one** Hub RPC WebSocket per page load. Modules call SAP-"
"shaped RPC methods (`conversation.*`, `task.*`, …) directly on that "
"transport."
msgstr ""
"壳内 bundled SPA 每个页面加载共享**一条** Hub RPC WebSocket。各模块直接在该传"
"输层上调用 SAP 形态的 RPC 方法（`conversation.*`、`task.*` 等）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:49
msgid ""
"Satellite processes connect with Hub RPC, then `sap.attach` with `app_id` / "
"`instance_id` before `tool.register` or instance-scoped methods."
msgstr ""
"Satellite 进程先通过 Hub RPC 连接，再以 `app_id` / `instance_id` 调用 "
"`sap.attach`，之后方可 `tool.register` 或使用实例范围的方法。"

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:50 docs/sap/transport.md:99 messages/po4a/en.xml:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconnect"
msgstr "重连"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:53
msgid ""
"Use `runHubRpcTransport` for connect, heartbeat, and exponential backoff "
"(default 1s → 30s cap). On satellite detach or socket close, Hub unregisters "
"tools for that instance."
msgstr ""
"使用 `runHubRpcTransport` 处理 connect、心跳与指数退避重连（默认 1s → 上限 "
"30s）。卫星 detach 或 socket 关闭时，Hub 注销该实例的工具。"

